WEBVTT

00:25:27.163 --> 00:25:31.121
which is I think my biggest
moment of shock in

00:25:31.121 --> 00:25:35.621
the new trilogy was when Emperor Palpatine
came back to life because

00:25:35.788 --> 00:25:38.038
I thought he'd been dead since 1983.

00:25:38.954 --> 00:25:42.996
And so I was wondering how you went
about rethinking his demise.

00:25:43.788 --> 00:25:48.871
Well, that was something that came in
and out and then back in again.

00:25:48.913 --> 00:25:52.788
But that idea was something that that
felt like it was sitting there,

00:25:52.788 --> 00:25:57.371
set up in the prequels. And when
we were looking at the story,

00:25:58.079 --> 00:26:02.413
the idea of a character who is
desperate to find immortality